The `householdId` is a stable SHA-256-derived id (`HH-<HEX12>`) built in `householdId(lastNameKey, addressKey)` (lines 223-237). Owners in the same household (same normalized lastName + address) get an identical `householdId`. `sharesHousehold` comes from `OwnerFieldsDto`.

**Relevant supporting class:** `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/AddressNormalizer.java` (normalizes addresses so household detection/id stay consistent).

**Service layer (passthrough):**
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicServiceImpl.java` lines 232-237:

```java
