@Transactional
public void saveOwner(Owner owner) throws DataAccessException {
    ownerRepository.save(owner);
}
```
Interface: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicService.java` (`void saveOwner(Owner owner)`, line 59).

Note: there is also a `v2` controller at `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v2/OwnerRestControllerV2.java` (did not contain the tier/household create logic; the create logic above is v1).

