## 4. Owner repository interface(s)

- Interface: **`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java`** — declares `findByLastName`, `findById`, `save`, `findAll`, `delete` (paged variants included).
